Hero mosaic screenshots go here.

Drop curated PNGs of shipped dashboards into this directory, then declare
each one in lib/screenshots.ts (that file has a commented-out template with
the exact shape and the project slugs that already have accent colours).

Two things to get right, because both are load-bearing:

  - width/height in the manifest must be the image's TRUE intrinsic pixel
    dimensions. next/image uses them to reserve space before the image
    loads; a wrong number reintroduces layout shift.

  - alt text is short, factual, and describes only what is visibly on
    screen. No metrics, no outcomes, no claims.

Nothing in this directory is generated or mocked up. The mosaic renders
exactly the files declared in the manifest, and renders nothing when the
manifest is empty.
